  "changes": [
    {
      "start": 70,
      "end": 454,
      "before": "**Full SysON parity remains open.** The [remaining-work guide](REMAINING-WORK.md) states what remains, the next independent PRs, the dependency order and the evidence required to finish. The [797-entry task register](remaining-work/units.json) retains every adopted task and links to its detailed brief. These are review units, not a feature-completion percentage or a final PR count.",
      "after": "**Full SysON parity remains open.** The [remaining-work guide](REMAINING-WORK.md) states what remains, the next independent PRs, the dependency order and the evidence required to finish. The [799-entry task register](remaining-work/units.json) retains every adopted task and links to its detailed brief. These are review units, not a feature-completion percentage or a final PR count.",
      "reason": "[README.md:current-line-3] Current register799 after adding two children; preserve review-unit/nonpercentage disclaimer. Preserve the complete surrounding historical guide; current-state wording is private proposed adoption only.",
      "plan_index": 0,
      "location": {
        "line": 3,
        "column": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "start": 456,
      "end": 1069,
      "before": "The current progress snapshot is **SYSON-RUST-REMAINING/2026-10-31.20**, based on main `c9c55fb741f26adc46719b9e21f01aebf6d9be1b`, under completion contract **1.0.11**. The [source-next amendment](amendments/1.0.11-source-next.md) registers the complete B25d1/B25d2 migration and M06a2 identity/SnapshotStore scopes while preserving all 794 earlier units, 55 historical records, dependencies and holds. The [team structure](TEAM-EXECUTION.md) and ordinary review caps remain unchanged; root retains shared wiring and serialized runtime ownership. Registration grants no implementation lease or feature acceptance.",
      "after": "The current progress snapshot is **SYSON-RUST-REMAINING/2026-10-31.21**, based on qualified facade main `PENDING_QUALIFIED_F_MAIN`, under completion contract **1.0.12**. The [identity integration amendment](amendments/1.0.12-identity-integration.md) registers M06a2a/M06a2b while preserving all 797 prior units, 55 historical records, dependencies and holds. The earlier [source-next amendment](amendments/1.0.11-source-next.md) registered B25d1/B25d2 and M06a2 while preserving its 794 earlier units. The [adoption disposition](COMPLETION-CONTRACT.md#candidate-1012-adoption-disposition) requires the reviewed atomic source, policy and catalogue, real generator output and complete normative/snapshot readback. The [team structure](TEAM-EXECUTION.md) and ordinary review caps remain unchanged; root retains shared wiring and serialized runtime ownership. Registration grants no implementation lease or feature acceptance.",
      "reason": "[README.md:current-line-5] Replace stale current.20/.11/base with actually installed.21/.12/qualified base; retain.11 historical amendment and preservation facts. Preserve the complete surrounding historical guide; current-state wording is private proposed adoption only.",
      "plan_index": 1,
      "location": {
        "line": 5,
        "column": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "start": 1071,
      "end": 2234,
      "before": "Finite geometry, literal JSON, reconciliation, linking and migration-preparation providers have landed with their named checks. The finite text importer is adopted as [#214](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/214). Offline upstream model replay [#213](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/213) reproduced all 36 project models; exact upstream compilation and application parity remain open. Migration participants [#220](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/220), [#221](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/221) and [#224](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/224), and unsigned registration tooling [#225](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/225), are also merged. SnapshotStore adoption [#228](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/228) and fault/filesystem qualification [#229](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/229) are merged. The [batch36 queue](rereview-batch36-next-prs.md) retains their historical dispatch; [M06a2](prs/M06a2.md) now specifies the next identity/import/edit/save/fresh-process reopen integration. The UI/backend-restart journey remains open. Existing source holds, #130's registrations and six reserved human starter tasks remain unchanged.",
      "after": "Finite geometry, literal JSON, reconciliation, linking and migration-preparation providers have landed with their named checks. The finite text importer is adopted as [#214](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/214). Offline upstream model replay [#213](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/213) reproduced all 36 project models; exact upstream compilation and application parity remain open. Migration participants [#220](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/220), [#221](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/221) and [#224](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/224), and unsigned registration tooling [#225](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/225), are also merged. SnapshotStore adoption [#228](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/228) and fault/filesystem qualification [#229](https://github.com/ajhcs/syson/pull/229) are merged. The [batch36 queue](rereview-batch36-next-prs.md) retains their historical dispatch; [M06a2](prs/M06a2.md) retains the full identity/import/edit/save/fresh-process reopen integration, with [M06a2a](prs/M06a2a.md) specifying functional completion and [M06a2b](prs/M06a2b.md) its required release measurements. The [facade](composition/identity_partition_prepare/FACADE.md), [constructors](composition/identity_partition_prepare/CONSTRUCT.md) and [restoration guard](composition/identity_partition_prepare/GUARD.md) retain their preparation scope; current adoption requires the qualified disposition and final artifact readback. The UI/backend-restart journey remains open. Existing source holds, #130's registrations and six reserved human starter tasks remain unchanged.",
      "reason": "[README.md:current-line-7] Replace single undivided next-M06a2 claim with full parent and its functional/measurement children, retaining every merged-PR/human hold/UI limitation. Preserve the complete surrounding historical guide; current-state wording is private proposed adoption only.",
      "plan_index": 2,
      "location": {
        "line": 7,
        "column": 1
      }
    }
  ],
